<title>HONG KONG: BZW increases Hutchison Whampoa warrants.</title>
<headline>BZW increases Hutchison Whampoa warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has raised the issue size of American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd to 70 million warrants from 60 million warrants, a BZW official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Terms of the warrants remain unchanged, she said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$57.958     GEARING	 6.04X</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.99	 PREMIUM	 13.57 PCT</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 26.NOV.97     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG     PAYDATE	 12.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$59.75	LISTING DATE  19.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR AT ISSUER'S CASH OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
